Package: BayesianDesignAna
Title: Bayesian Multi-Arm Binary Trial Design and Analysis with Control Borrowing
Version: 0.6.0
Authors@R: person('Jinhao', 'Zou', role = c('aut', 'cre'), email = 'maintainer@example.org')
Description: Simulate Bayesian multi-arm binary endpoint trials with historical
    control borrowing and multiplicity decisions, plan sample sizes, and fit
    Bayesian logistic models with stratification covariates. Provides design
    prior effective sample size summaries and optional meta-analytic predictive
    priors through RBesT. Defaults to baseline Jeffreys Beta priors for binomial endpoints without automatic historical borrowing. Includes configurable HPD and equal-tailed credible intervals and SAS-style posterior summaries. Requires independent validation before use in clinical trials.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: stats, utils
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0), RBesT, knitr, rmarkdown
Config/testthat/edition: 3
VignetteBuilder: knitr
URL: https://github.com/JinhaoZou/ST1_1_Bayesian_Design_Ana
BugReports: https://github.com/JinhaoZou/ST1_1_Bayesian_Design_Ana/issues
